pan style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"timed_out\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"datasets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"datasets/orders.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"record_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">37</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"columns\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"datetime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"tz\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UTC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount_minor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"redactions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"datasets/orders.csv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"column\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recipient_phone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"third_party_personal_data\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"delivery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"signed_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"expires_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-05T10:02:11Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段值得单独说明。<code>coverage</code> 记录应答与超时系统数——如果某个系统超时，导出包必须在元数据里声明这一点，而不是静默交付一个不完整的包；这是「诚实的交付」，也是<a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-evidence-request-log\">审计留痕</a>的要求。<code>redactions</code> 显式记录被遮蔽的字段及理由，让审查者能核实遮蔽是按规则做的而非遗漏。<code>delivery.expires_at</code> 让交付物有一个有限的有效期，避免这份高度敏感的文件永久暴露在一个可猜测的链接下。</p>\n<h3 id=\"大包的生成与投递\">大包的生成与投递</h3><p>导出包的大小是真实的工程约束。一个活跃买家可能有几十万条行为日志、几万个订单事件，序列化后可达数 GB。三项措施：<strong>流式生成</strong>（不把整个包载入内存，边查边写）、<strong>分片</strong>（按数据集或按时间窗口切成多个文件，manifest 索引）、<strong>异步投递</strong>（生成完成后通过短时效签名链接或对象存储预签名 URL 交付，而不是在 HTTP 响应里直接返回）。</p>\n<p>大包还引出时限问题：生成耗时可能占用相当比例的响应窗口。因此生成任务应当与<a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-deadline-sla-workflow\">计时器</a>联动，设置内部里程碑（例如「第 3 天必须完成检索，第 10 天必须完成生成」），在里程碑未达成时预警，而不是等到 deadline 当天才发现包还在生成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE dsr_export_package (&#10;  package_id     TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  request_id     TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES dsr_request(request_id),&#10;  kind           TEXT NOT NULL,          -- access | portability&#10;  state          TEXT NOT NULL,          -- building|ready|delivered|expired|revoked&#10;  byte_size      BIGINT,&#10;  dataset_count  INTEGER,&#10;  coverage_ok    BOOLEAN NOT NULL,       -- 是否所有系统都已应答&#10;  manifest       JSONB,&#10;  artifact_uri   TEXT,                   -- 对象存储位置&#10;  delivery_link  TEXT,&#10;  link_expires_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  built_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  delivered_at   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  revoked_at     TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dsr_export_package</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  package_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_request(request_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- access | portability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- building|ready|delivered|expired|revoked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  byte_size      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dataset_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  coverage_ok    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 是否所有系统都已应答</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  manifest       JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  artifact_uri   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 对象存储位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivery_link  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  link_expires_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  built_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivered_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revoked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>revoked_at</code> 字段支持撤回：当事人在请求处理期间撤回了导出请求，或发现导出包含了不应包含的内容时，平台应当能撤销尚未使用的交付链接。这属于资源生命周期管理的一部分——一个生成出来但从未送达的包，其数据也不应长期停留在临时存储里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码-投递与对账\">编码、投递与对账</h2><h3 id=\"编码与本地化细节\">编码与本地化细节</h3><p>两个容易在集成测试中才发现的问题。其一是<strong>字符编码与时间格式</strong>：CSV 载荷必须统一为 UTF-8（含 BOM 与否要写进 manifest，因为下家工具对此敏感），时间必须统一为带时区的 ISO 8601 并显式声明时区，否则同一份订单在跨时区解析时会出现一天偏移。其二是<strong>金额表示</strong>：不要用浮点数，用最小货币单位整数加货币码，并在 manifest 的列定义里声明 <code>currency</code>——这一点在多币种电商场景下是必需品而非可选项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交付后的对账\">交付后的对账</h3><p>导出包交付不是终点。两类对账必须做：<strong>覆盖对账</strong>（<code>coverage_ok</code> 为假时，必须在答复中告知当事人哪些系统未能应答，并说明将如何处理）与<strong>送达对账</strong>（链接是否被实际使用、是否过期、是否被撤销）。这两项同时服务于<a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-quality-completion-rate\">指标</a>——「完成」的定义应当包含覆盖完整性与交付确认，否则完成率会虚高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>访问交付给人，可携带交付给机器；把可携带做成 PDF 是常见且实质性的错误。</li>\n<li>可携带的范围由三个法定门槛决定，平台推断数据不在其中，但仍在访问范围内。</li>\n<li>格式上宜以 JSON 为封套、CSV 为载荷；manifest 提供字段语义与来源信息。</li>\n<li>兼容第三人权利是硬约束（Art. 15(4)），必须在管线里做字段级主体归属判定。</li>\n<li>大包需流式生成、分片、异步投递，且生成里程碑应与计时器联动。</li>\n<li><code>coverage</code>、<code>redactions</code>、<code>link_expires_at</code>、<code>revoked_at</code> 四个字段让交付可对账、可撤回、可举证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可携带数据导出包生成","id":"可携带数据导出包生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"格式选择：JSON 还是 CSV","id":"格式选择-json-还是-csv"},{"level":3,"text":"兼容第三人权利是硬约束","id":"兼容第三人权利是硬约束"},{"level":2,"text":"导出包的封装结构","id":"导出包的封装结构"},{"level":3,"text":"大包的生成与投递","id":"大包的生成与投递"},{"level":2,"text":"编码、投递与对账","id":"编码-投递与对账"},{"level":3,"text":"编码与本地化细节","id":"编码与本地化细节"},{"level":3,"text":"交付后的对账","id":"交付后的对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"按身份图谱定位散落数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/data-subject-rights-fulfillment/cross-system-data-locate/identity-data-graph-locate"},"next":{"title":"法定保留例外范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/data-subject-rights-fulfillment/cross-system-data-locate/legal-hold-exception-scope"}}